-- Generated by `prisma migrate dev --create-only` against the local cnc_db,
-- then the hand-written part appended below the line: CHECKs, the two
-- partial unique indexes that make a double booking and a double table
-- allocation impossible, and the append-only trigger on StockMovement.
-- `prisma migrate diff --from-config-datasource --to-schema
-- prisma/schema.prisma --script` prints an empty migration once this is
-- applied.
--
